sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant S as Source workspace
    participant VA as Staging A (source)
    participant VB as Staging B (target)
    participant Tg as Target workspace
    Op->>S: Run "airgap_source" Job (01 Inventory + 02 Export)
    activate S
    S->>VA: write bundle + manifest
    deactivate S
    Note over VA,VB: Operator PHYSICALLY moves the bundle<br/>(download from A, upload to B) - the only thing that crosses
    Op->>Tg: Run 04 Import (dry_run=true)
    activate Tg
    Tg->>VB: read bundle, verify manifest (counts + checksums)
    deactivate Tg
    Tg-->>Op: dry-run reports
    Op->>Tg: Run 04 Import (dry_run=false)
    activate Tg
    Tg->>VB: read bundle
    Tg->>Tg: create/update in dependency order, ACLs last
    deactivate Tg
    Tg-->>Op: import reports + manual_actions_import.md
